{"t":"NXT","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Nextpower Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Solar","employees":1993,"hq":"Fremont, CA, United States","website":"https://www.nextpower.com","summary_en":"Nextpower Inc. provides solar and energy technology solutions for utility-scale power plants in the United States and internationally. It offers tracking solutions, including NX Horizon, a solar tracking solution; NX Horizon-XTR, a terrain-following tracker to expand the addressable market for trackers on sites with sloped, uneven, and challenging terrain; NX Horizon Hail Pro adds automatic stowing using weather service information; and NX Horizon Low Carbon, a solar tracker solution with a reduced carbon footprint. The company also provides TrueCapture, an energy yield management system that addresses power production shortfalls; NX Anchor and NX Earth Truss, a solar foundation technology to facilitate solar project development in challenging soil conditions; Truss Driver, an advanced installation equipment; and NX Navigator, which assists solar power plant owners and operators in monitoring, controlling, and protecting their solar projects. It serves engineering, procurement, and construction firms, as well as solar project developers and owners. The company was formerly known as Nextracker Inc. and changed its name to Nextpower Inc. in November 2025. The company was founded in 2013 and is headquartered in Fremont, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Nextpower Inc.는 미국 및 전 세계의 유틸리티 규모 발전소에 태양광 및 에너지 기술 솔루션을 제공합니다. 태양광 추적 솔루션인 NX Horizon을 포함한 추적 솔루션을 제공합니다. 경사지고 고르지 않으며 까다로운 지형이 있는 현장의 추적기 시장을 확장하기 위한 지형 추적 추적기인 NX Horizon-XTR NX Horizon Hail Pro는 기상 서비스 정보를 사용하여 자동 적재 기능을 추가합니다. 그리고 탄소 배출량을 줄인 태양광 추적기 솔루션인 NX Horizon Low Carbon이 있습니다. 또한 회사는 전력 생산 부족을 해결하는 에너지 수율 관리 시스템인 TrueCapture를 제공합니다. 까다로운 토양 조건에서 태양광 프로젝트 개발을 촉진하는 태양광 기초 기술인 NX Anchor 및 NX Earth Truss 첨단 설치 장비인 트러스 드라이버(Truss Driver); 태양광 발전소 소유자와 운영자가 태양광 프로젝트를 모니터링, 제어 및 보호하는 데 도움을 주는 NX Navigator. 엔지니어링, 조달 및 건설 회사는 물론 태양광 프로젝트 개발자 및 소유자에게도 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Nextracker Inc.로 알려졌으며 2025년 11월에 Nextpower Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 2013년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 프리몬트에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":70.575,"mcap":10761583616.0,"pe":17.777077,"fpe":12.713467,"peg":3.1548,"ps":2.8066509,"pb":4.0202217,"ev_ebitda":12.759,"div":0.0,"beta":1.926,"hi52":163.13,"lo52":67.0},"fin":{"rev":3834315008.0,"rev_g":0.225,"eps_g":0.113,"gross":0.21836,"op":0.18634,"net":0.15978,"roe":0.26455998,"fcf":370624640.0,"cash":1029886016.0,"debt":44500000.0,"de":1.682,"eps":3.97,"feps":5.5512},"own":{"short":0.0942,"inst":1.08752,"insider":0.0068900003},"analyst":{"n":29,"mean":126.31034,"median":125.0,"high":164.0,"low":70.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.43333,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":7,"buy":20,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":7,"buy":19,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":7,"buy":19,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":6,"buy":19,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-12","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":120.0,"priorPriceTarget":116.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":126.0,"priorPriceTarget":119.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":115.0,"priorPriceTarget":110.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":125.0,"priorPriceTarget":55.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"GLJ Research","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises"